{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25459","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 西岭望鸣臯山 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 西岭望鸣臯山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高秋对凉野，四望何萧瑟。\n远见鸣臯山，青峰原上出。\n晨兴采薇蕨，向暮归蓬荜。\n讵假数挥金，餐和养余日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25459.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25459","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}